# GS17: from the goma_entrance save (Goma Cave Entrance; continue with vale_day1_continue.keys + --flash-in). Up the
# west bank (5,17), across the pool's posts to 13,17, round to 14,19: walking east twice pushes the west pillar off the
# ladder (16,18-19); up it to the y-32 ledge (14,12), east along row 17 to 22,17: Move on the east pillar, LEFT pulls it
# to column 23 where it sinks into the floor (A/B/L/R end Move); over it, up the north-east ladder (27,14) to the y-64
# level, west below the trees (row 15, 18,15), up to 16,11, west to 14,11 facing the ivy-bound stump (12,11 at y 64:
# Move reaches only 8 px of height): Move, LEFT, A ends it: "It's no use..." (GomaCaveEntrance_IvanRejoins), Ivan's
# Whirlwind, Ivan joins (f~9400); Move on the stump again, LEFT: it leaps into the pool (column 11); onto the pedestal
# (12,11), facing north: Ivan's Whirlwind blows the tall ivy off the cave mouth; north into Goma Cave (f12177).
